{"id":"c973cbf3deff3126","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-simple-set.md","title":"Simple Set","display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-simple-set","aliases":["92-df-simple-set"],"display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-simple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-simple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-set — Simple Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> (definition target simple-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to|B|&lt;\\aleph_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to|B|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是简单集</li>\n<li>简单集是r.e.但不可判定</li>\n<li>补集是无限的，但没有无限r.e.子集</li>\n<li>补集是&quot;immune&quot;集</li>\n<li>简单集不是创造集，因而不是 c.e. 集中的多一完全集；这不表示不存在任何集合可多一归约到它</li>\n<li>简单集的存在表明创造集不是不可判定r.e.集的唯一类型</li>\n<li>Post构造了简单集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\;(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\to|B|<\\aleph_0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"91aef0bb06ab9396","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$ (simple-set predicate, see [[92-df-simple-set]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bba